        // ~44 GB RSS at Q4 — the footprint is weight-bound, not resolution/frame-bound.
        // Q4 is the default (fits 64 GB-class Macs, faster). Q8 (higher quality) is opt-in
        // via the advanced `mlxQuantize: 8` control but runs CLOSE to the ceiling: a 256²
        // Q8 t2v peaked ~98 GB memory-footprint on a 128 GB Mac — it passes in isolation,
        // but aborts the Metal allocation under memory pressure (back-to-back loads) and
